{"unit_id":"Quqing-future__dsh-jimeng#card-zh","repo":"Quqing-future/dsh-jimeng","commit":"a50e7b3db90f997ca16b758eee406a88421c0a6c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jimeng 是面向 DSH Web 的即梦 Seedream 图片生成插件，通过注册模型工具、Web 设置面板和图片结果预览，把文生图与参考图编辑接入对话和手动操作流程。用户可用 generate_image 按文字提示生成一至四张图片，也可用 image_to_image 输入一至十张本地图片、URL 或 data URL 作为参考；结果会保存到本地并显示在对话中。设置面板支持配置 API Key、兼容服务地址、模型、尺寸、水印和保存目录，也能手动生成或检测模型。适合需要在 DSH 中创作或编辑图片的用户；需要可用的图片生成 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:296-365","index.js:153-204","client.js:513-619","client.js:644-663"]}
{"unit_id":"Quqing-future__dsh-jimeng#card-en","repo":"Quqing-future/dsh-jimeng","commit":"a50e7b3db90f997ca16b758eee406a88421c0a6c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-jimeng adds Seedream image generation to DSH Web. Use generate_image for prompts or image_to_image to edit with references. Results are saved locally and shown in chat. Settings configure the API key, service URL, models, size, watermark, and save directory; a panel supports manual generation.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:296-365","index.js:153-204","client.js:513-619","client.js:644-663"]}
