{"unit_id":"Quqing-future__dsh-jimeng#feature-1","repo":"Quqing-future/dsh-jimeng","commit":"a50e7b3db90f997ca16b758eee406a88421c0a6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jimeng 的「文字生成图片」功能：在对话中调用 generate_image 并提供 prompt，可选指定尺寸和生成张数；图片会保存到本地并作为结果显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:296-320","index.js:240-294"]}
