{"unit_id":"Quqing-future__dsh-jimeng#caveat-1","repo":"Quqing-future/dsh-jimeng","commit":"a50e7b3db90f997ca16b758eee406a88421c0a6c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jimeng 使用前须知：生成和编辑请求会把提示词及所选参考图发送到配置的图片服务；默认服务为火山方舟 Ark，API Key 需在设置中配置。（见 index.js:153-171）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:153-171"]}
